    story: Daniel Drunkwound was born in a dune camp, where water, shade, and distance
      shaped every decision. As a child, Daniel Drunkwound lived through a merchant
      school, learning letters, rivalry, discipline, and how rules can be used as
      weapons. As a young adult, Daniel Drunkwound worked through a shield line soldier,
      turning drills, fear, formation work, and orders into practical violence. They
      enter the dojo to win coin without taking orders.
